total                                    472             111       583

  M0 was RIGHT on all 583. A cell is BROKEN by an arm when that arm's
  after-state is wrong.
  broken by R ALONE   (R wrong, B right)   176
  broken by B ALONE   (R right, B wrong)   62
  broken by BOTH                           49
  broken by NEITHER                        296
  P1 asks whether the FIRST is smaller than the second. 176 vs 62.
