====================================================================================================
(4) R AGAINST jd5-B — THE SAME OBJECTIONS WITH AND WITHOUT A ROUND  [DESCRIPTIVE]
====================================================================================================
The natural third column: jd5-B ruled these same 896 objections under the same
prompt and the same judge model, with NOBODY answering them.

THE PROVIDER CAVEAT, AND IT IS WHY THIS IS NOT AN ENDPOINT. jd5-B's judge was
UNPINNED and jd6's is pinned to DigitalOcean; §3aa measured 34% of M1's rulings
on DeepInfra against 4.8% of jd5-B's. So this table mixes the round with the
routing and cannot separate them. Section (1) can, because both its arms are
pinned to the same provider.
